Code origin

Redrob CAD started from the source of CADCraft (https://github.com/storytold/cadcraft) at its
release tag v0.3.0, commit 59631c8d4f9ffe6c08c5c2065ea17504e53bf821 (2026-10-08), whose copyright
notice is kept above and in LICENSE-MIT. It is no longer synced with that project: since the cut
the code is developed here independently, and all names in it are Redrob CAD's own.

The ArtCraft name, wordmark and logos are trademarks of the ArtCraft Team. Redrob CAD does not
use or ship them. The Redrob name and mark (assets/brand/, assets/app-icon/) belong to Redrob and
come from the Redrob design system; they are not covered by the license above.

Third-party material

Software dependencies are listed in Cargo.lock. One is under a weak-copyleft licence: the acadrust
crate (DWG reading and writing, https://github.com/hakanaktt/acadrust) is licensed under the
Mozilla Public License 2.0 and is used unmodified as a separate library (crates/dwg). Its source
is available from crates.io and the repository above.

The Korean UI font Wanted Sans (crates/ui-egui/assets/fonts/WantedSans-Regular.ttf) is
Copyright 2024 The Wanted Sans Project Authors (https://github.com/wanteddev/wanted-sans) and is
licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (WantedSans-OFL.txt beside it).
